title "--stable map.fitd.lock"
layout layered dir=down
page 320x180mm margin=1cm

style lock color=#BC4C00

node why "Why"
| the solver is global: one new node can move every
| other one and change the font
node read "Read the lock" .lock
| font, page, and every node center
| plain text, diffs well, can be committed
node try "Try locked spots first"
| nodes added since the lock are placed freely;
| removed ones are dropped
node charge "Charge every move"
| about one edge crossing per node that leaves
| its spot, plus a pull per em of distance
node fonts "Polish two fonts"
| the locked font, while it still fits,
| and the new largest; better merit wins
node write "Write the lock" .lock
node result "Effect"
| adding one leaf keeps the font and every spot;
| deleting a large branch lets the font grow
| the build log counts the nodes that kept their spots
node skip "Ignored or skipped"
| a lock for another page size is ignored with a note
| the warning-driven retry is skipped: it would move everything
| delete the lock to lay out afresh

why -> read -> try -> charge -> fonts -> write
fonts -> result
read ..> skip
write ..> read "next build"
